        "sizeSource": "estimate: ambientCG publishes no dimensions; 4 x 4 square slabs per tile, read as standard 50 cm pavers",
        "why": "Chosen over Poly Haven interlocking_concrete_pavers: large neutral square slabs read cleanly from a high camera and sit with the cream/pastel palette and terrazzo; the interlocking set is a busy red-brown diamond pattern that reads as a driveway.",
